    "body": "Ready for a re-check. Head 6a6f3059b closes the finding of the pre-review.\n- An Attention chip that has no room for its glyph now paints a warn bar at the chip foot (`StateFit::Mark`). Pinned by `a_short_pane_paints_the_glyph_alone_not_nothing` and `an_attention_chip_paints_a_state_at_every_height`.\n- The decision file and the test text now say so. The folded mark is for a pane too short for the title.\n- Nits: the stale test asserts the exact count. The blocked test asserts the exact text with warnings last. The doc comments and the `fold_state.rs` header are updated.\nQuick gate and clippy are green on this head, with the parent branch as base. The PR stays a draft.\n",
